# Server Actions

- Start every file with `'use server'`.
- Validate all inputs with Zod before any Prisma call.
- Return `{ success: boolean; error?: string; data?: T }` from mutations.
- Use `auth.api.getSession({ headers: await headers() })` for auth; redirect or return error when unauthenticated.
- Use Prisma `include`/`select` — no JS-loop joins.
- Do not use `any`; infer types from Prisma payloads and Zod schemas.
- Do not create `src/app/api/**/route.ts` for internal CRUD (auth routes excepted).
- Call `revalidatePath` after mutations that affect cached pages.
